title: What I decided
pid: d96ce674-a4a2-443e-8f3c-fd4f121d0d6c
body: |2-
  The root's author is followed throughout the view, beneath a third
  author's notes too, and the view draws nothing new to say so. Reasons
  are under "following, as built", "A view follows the overrides of its
  root's author."
